DTEND:20260914T125130Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:16:29 and reappears at 18:18:57 IST\, se
 en from Pune.\nThe Moon is 40° up in the SW · daylight\, Sun +18°.\nTim
 es against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's 
 edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Pune
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Pune
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
